  "recreation_notes": [
    {
      "line_end": 9,
      "line_start": 1,
      "status": "candidate",
      "text": "Banzai Run / IPD No. 175 / May 20, 1988 / 4 Players\nWilliams Electronics Games, Incorporated, a subsidiary of WMS Ind., Incorporated (1985-1999) [Trade Name: Williams]\nVPX8 table by jpsalas. This is for desktop and FS. Can be played on 1 screen.\nvpinmame based on table by Lio & Freylis & Destruk\nAubrel: Changed the code to show the lifter and the ball in table's backwall.\nAubrel: ShowUpperPF activation updated to switch-on only when the ball reach the top playfield level.\nAubrel: Fix the magnet code to take the ball only when in the lowest position and small rotation added.\nAubrel: Lifter switches code fixed, old switches hack removed, lifter's moves are now accurate ! :)"
    }
  ],
